the facade in our example will be so now instead of dealing with the whole process of making pasta
where we need to use any item we want and need to use we only use 1 method where the API will be simple
the clients should gaf about changes in API as long as the facade class supports them as well.
    Public class Chef {
    private SaltShaker saltShaker;
    private Pantry pantry;
    private Pot pot;
    public Chef() {
        this.saltShaker = new SaltShaker();
        this.pantry = new Pantry();
        this.pot = new Pot();
    }

    pubic void makePasta() {
        pot.boil(2);
        Item pasta = pantry.get("pasta");
        pot.add(pasta);
        Salt salt = saltShaker.get(1);
        pot.add(salt);
    }
}